export class ComprobanteErrorCtrl{static $inject=["$scope","mainService","commonService","$uibModalInstance","params"];constructor($scope,_mS,_commonSvc,$uibModalInstance,_params){this.$scope=$scope,this._mS=_mS,this.$uibModalInstance=$uibModalInstance,this._params=_params,this.formatDate="MM/dd/yyyy h:mma"}$onInit(){this._mS.getData("get","/DocumentoElectronicoError/Get?json="+JSON.stringify(this._params)).then(response=>{this.erroresComprobante=JSON.parse(response.payload)||[]})}showInfoAdicional(item){Swal.fire({icon:"info",html:`<small>${item.informacionAdicional}</small>`})}closeModal(){this.$uibModalInstance.close()}}